      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ディルマギアが工業化に進む中で、\r\n自然を愛する種族は、集落ごと魔法で転移した。",
        "official_en": "As the industrialization of Dilmagia progressed, the race that loved nature teleported away, along with their entire settlement.",
