      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ドワーフの歌に隠された意味……。\r\nもう少し手がかりが欲しいものだ。",
        "official_en": "The hidden meaning behind the dwarven songs... If only we had more to go on.",
        "real_en": "The hidden meaning in that dwarven song... I wish we had a few more clues."
